<header class="en-guide-header"><p class="en-overline">ARGENTINE LITERATURE · AN ENGLISH READER’S GUIDE</p><h1>What Is <em>Martín Fierro</em>? The Story, Meaning, and History of Argentina’s Gaucho Epic</h1><p class="en-deck">A man sings about losing his home, his freedom, and his place in the world. Through his voice, José Hernández turned the hardships of Argentina’s nineteenth-century countryside into one of the country’s most enduring literary works.</p><div class="en-byline">MARTINFIERRO.ORG · Documentary reading guide · Original works: 1872 and 1879</div></header>
